{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c2a2c2a2-0002-4b02-9b02-civicfrontend02",
    "name": "CIVIC-AI Frontend Pages → API Map",
    "description": "════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n CIVIC-AI FRONTEND — HAR PAGE KA BACKEND API MAP\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nYe collection document karta hai ki frontend (Vite dev server: http://localhost:8080) ka har page/backend feature kaunse REST endpoints + WebSocket se chalta hai. Postman me testing ke liye har page ke exact requests ready hain.\n\n▶ FRONTEND API BASE\nsrc/services/api.ts → VITE_API_URL env var, default http://localhost:8000/api\n\n▶ AUTH FLOW (frontend jaise hi)\n1. Login → tokens localStorage me save hote hain (civic-ai-access-token / civic-ai-refresh-token)\n2. Har request par axios interceptor `Authorization: Bearer <token>` lagata hai\n3. 401 aane par auto /auth/refresh retry hota hai\n4. Page load par GET /auth/me se session restore\n\n▶ SETUP\nPehle 'Auth → Login' folder me se login chalao — tokens auto-save honge.\n\n▶ PAGE ROUTES (browser)\n/landing • /login • /signup • /dashboard • /live-feeds • /alerts • /map • /analytics • /incidents • /operators • /settings • * (404)\n\n▶ REAL-TIME\nws://localhost:8000/ws — naye alerts ka broadcast (new_alert), alert updates, camera status changes, settings updates.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "civic-ai"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "api", "value": "http://localhost:8000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "frontend", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "page_alert_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth · Login & Signup Pages",
      "description": "Pages: /login, /signup, /landing (demo buttons)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "→ Login page: Operator Sign In (submit)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", json.access_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refresh_token\", json.refresh_token);",
                  "  console.log(\"✅ Frontend jaise tokens save ho gaye\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"operator\",\n  \"password\": \"operator123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{api}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login form ya 1-click demo buttons yahi call karte hain. Identifier username YA email ho sakta hai (api.ts `includes('@')` check karta hai).\n\nDemo creds: operator/operator123 • supervisor/supervisor123 • admin/admin123"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "→ Signup page: Officer Provisioning (submit)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"signup.test\",\n  \"email\": \"signup.test@smartcity.gov\",\n  \"password\": \"test1234\",\n  \"name\": \"Signup Test Officer\",\n  \"badge\": \"SEC-5511\",\n  \"department\": \"Urban CCTV Command Unit\",\n  \"zone\": \"Sector 1 (Metropolitan)\",\n  \"role\": \"operator\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{api}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Signup form submit → ye request → success par auto-login (register ke turant baad login call hoti hai AuthContext me).\n409 = username/email already taken (frontend error toast dikhata hai)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "→ Page load: session restore (GET /auth/me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{api}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "App load par AuthContext localStorage token se session restore karta hai — token valid nahi to user null (login pe redirect)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "→ Landing page: hero live stats",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{api}}/cameras",
              "host": ["{{api}}"],
              "path": ["cameras"]
            },
            "description": "LandingPage hero telemetry strip: cameras count (LIVE STREAMS card) + /alerts se total incidents (INCIDENTS LOGGED card) + preview frame thumbnails aur latest alerts ticker."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
